"Briant, Libor Prokop, Regis Plichart and Thibaud Guillaud-Saumur, with the "
"help of association \"Fa'afaite i te Ao Ma'ohi\" (Rereao Carlson, Titaua "
"Teipoarii) for the Maui's Hook/Hiro's Kite constellation and the association"
" \"Te Fare Hiroà no Vavau\" for the mention of Ruanui in the skyculture "
"name. WALKER Maurani did the translation of this text from French to "
"English."
msgstr ""
"本天空文化由一个工作小组共同贡献，成员包括克里斯汀·布里昂（Christine Briant）、利博尔·普罗科普（Libor "
"Prokop）、雷吉斯·普利沙尔（Regis Plichart）和蒂博·吉约·索米尔（Thibaud Guillaud-"
